壊すけどいいの？
I'll break it down, but is that okay?

239
00:25:02,345 --> 00:25:05,145
トラウマさえ愛して
Love me, even my trauma,

240
00:25:05,145 --> 00:25:07,145
です・です・て・です・です
desu, desu, te, desu, desu!

