シナリオを壊して抗うんだ
I will break the scenario and fight back!

283
00:30:13,665 --> 00:30:18,665
世界を敵に回したとしても
Even if I turn the world against me,

284
00:30:18,665 --> 00:30:23,665
信じて差し出す手のひら
I believe and reach out my palm.

285
00:30:24,165 --> 00:30:27,165
決して放さない
I'll never let go,

286
00:30:27,165 --> 00:30:30,165
答えは届いた
the answer has reached.

287
