00:53:54,161 --> 00:53:58,161
12.16
[Screen: 12.16]

584
00:54:05,161 --> 00:54:07,161
不安も、
[Screen: Anxiety,]

585
00:54:07,161 --> 00:54:08,161
否定も、
[Screen: denial,]

586
00:54:08,161 --> 00:54:10,161
葛藤も。
